{"id":"666651","name":"赛螃蟹","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/666651/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"鸡蛋","amount":"四个"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"一小块"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"姜切成姜末。","img":"images/666651/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"姜末用醋浸泡。","img":"images/666651/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"蛋黄装在碗内。","img":"images/666651/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"在蛋黄内，加少许盐，蛋黄搅均匀。","img":"images/666651/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"蛋清装在碗内。","img":"images/666651/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"在蛋清内，加少许水和盐，再将蛋清打发。","img":"images/666651/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"炒锅烧热后，放入适量油，将蛋清倒入锅中。","img":"images/666651/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"调小火，然后将凝结的蛋清搅拌碎后。","img":"images/666651/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"装盘备用。","img":"images/666651/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"再倒入适量油烧热，将鸡蛋黄倒入锅中。","img":"images/666651/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"将鸡蛋黄搅散至完全凝结，再将醋泡好的姜末倒入锅内。","img":"images/666651/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/666651/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"将炒好的鸡蛋黄倒入锅中。","img":"images/666651/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"搅拌均匀。","img":"images/666651/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"装盘即食。","img":"images/666651/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"嫩滑鲜美！","img":"images/666651/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}